# OSV waivers for the bashy ollama verified build.
#
# One OSV id per line (GO-YYYY-NNNN), followed by a justification on the same
# line or in the comment above it. The audit job fails on any OSV finding
# whose id is not listed here. Matching is by exact id only. An empty list
# means nothing is waived.
#
# A waiver is a review decision, not a convenience: record who accepted it,
# why the finding cannot be exploited in bashy's configuration, and what
# would retire it (an upstream pin bump, almost always).

