# Ollama module advisories (github.com/ollama/ollama), recorded 2026-10-14.
# Every entry below has NO patched version in the Go vulnerability database or
# in GitHub's advisory database (first_patched_version null) for any Ollama
# release, so no version bump can clear it; every Ollama build, including the
# official upstream binaries, carries them. govulncheck -mode=binary flags all
# Ollama symbols because these records carry no per-symbol detail.
# Risk accepted by the operator (dhnt), 2026-10-14, Sprint 436, on the
# recommendation of s436-manager. This build ships ONLY cmd/runner: a
# loopback-only child process exposing health, completion and embedding, with
# outbound network access blocked, loading models only from the host's local
# model store. Retire each entry when upstream ships a fix (then bump
# UPSTREAM_TAG) or when the advisory is withdrawn/narrowed to symbols the
# runner does not contain. Review again at every UPSTREAM_TAG bump.
#
# Not applicable to the runner (server-only code paths):
